it's common question in interview
how you implement a method to reverse a singly linked-list?
we have "reverse()" method on LinkedList JAVA class for this.

1->2->3
3->2->1

Note: we have just single while loop
      so it is O(1)
      but we could use bad algorithm like two nested loop
      one read from beginning, one write from end
      that method runtime complexity will be O(n^2)

Note: java link-list "reverse()"
      does not return any thing!
      it reverse the link-list inplace!
      he just update the pre/next pointers.

